                          X-PWD - Version 2.00
                          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

This  Program  Just Sets the password in mail packets before them are packed,
useful  if  you  plan  to use XMail!.  Whith this little program, you will be
able to set passwords and be secure about your mail.

It  also  Checks  the  Incoming .pkt files for the right passwords, providing
security check also in Inbound files.

From  Version 2.00 and Up the program have been compiled for O.S.  2.04+, ask
for 1.3 version!  Or Upgrade your O.S.!!!

